  "worked_solution": "The parametric equations of a circle  of radius $r$ centered at  the origin are\n\n$$\nx=r\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta ,\\,y=r\\operatorname{sin}\u2061\\theta ,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$\n\nUnder this parametrization, the circle is traversed once in the counterclockwise direction, starting from $(r,0).$\n\nIn our case, the radius $r=5.$ Therefore, the parametric equations of the circle are \n\n$$\nx=5\\operatorname{cos}\u2061\\theta ,\\,y=5\\operatorname{sin}\u2061\\theta ,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$",
